      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.03 (up from ₹0.35 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.61m (down 100% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹676.3m (up ₹597.9m from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 67 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
