      "type": "event",
      "date": "2025-12-03T13:06:00.000Z",
      "title": "Nectar Lifesciences Limited (NSEI:NECLIFE) announces an Equity Buyback for 30,000,000 shares, representing 13.38% for INR 810 million.",
      "body": "Nectar Lifesciences Limited (NSEI:NECLIFE) announces a share repurchase program. Under the program, the company will repurchase up to 30,000,000 shares, representing 13.38% of its issued share capital for INR 810 million. The shares will be repurchased at a price of INR 27 per share. The fixed Record date of buyback is December 24, 2025. As of November 28, 2025, the company had 224,260,970 shares issued and outstanding.",
